Subject: [PATCH] Share NativeLink artifacts through APFS clones before publication

Base: upstream 9a1876786f32806f6b65fc51f4c1c3077efc38a5 plus the preceding
Sekka engine patches. Linux retains its FICLONE/FIDEDUPERANGE pipeline.
Darwin uploads verified private snapshots under action ownership, then
clones the CAS into unpublished outputs. Cache hits and materializer copies
use independent, verified APFS clones. NativeLink is never modified directly.

